          "note": "Only states whose caps were checked against the statute text are listed. Other states are not modeled (no deduction is taken). Every listed state requires contributions to its own program; the plan setting asserts that. Caps are per return per year; per-beneficiary or per-account caps and recapture of earlier deductions are not modeled."
        },
